## Third-party notices

This project is a host shell for mpv. It does not contain mpv source code or
mpv binaries; both are fetched or built separately and remain under their own
licences:

- mpv — GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later (https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv)
- FFmpeg — LGPL-2.1-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later (https://ffmpeg.org)

If you redistribute a build that bundles libmpv and FFmpeg libraries, you are
responsible for complying with those licences.
